+      "original_source_text": "@startuml\nskinparam monochrome true\ntitle B14 — Mua vé, một Saga do Payment điều phối\nactor Buyer\nparticipant Booking\ndatabase \"Booking DB\" as BDB\nparticipant Payment\ndatabase \"Payment DB\" as PDB\nparticipant Gateway\nparticipant Ticket\ndatabase \"Ticket DB\" as TDB\nBuyer -> Booking : Tạo đơn + Idempotency-Key\nBooking -> BDB : TX: order + reservation + allocations + counters\nBuyer -> Payment : Bắt đầu thanh toán\nPayment -> Booking : freeze-payment (subject đã xác thực)\nBooking -> BDB : TX: kiểm deadline + lưu snapshot frozen\nBooking --> Payment : Cùng snapshot cho retry\nPayment -> PDB : TX: snapshot + attempt trước gọi cổng\nPayment -> Gateway : Tạo thanh toán\nGateway -> Payment : IPN có chữ ký / query result\nPayment -> PDB : TX: charge + Saga + outbox\nPayment -> Booking : accept-payment qua broker\nBooking -> BDB : TX: inbox + deadline/accepted charge + ISSUING + outbox\nBooking --> Payment : ACCEPTED / LATE / DUPLICATE / CANCELLED\nalt ACCEPTED\n  Payment -> PDB : TX: confirmation + WAITING_TICKETS + outbox\n  Payment -> Ticket : issue (purchase snapshot)\n  Ticket -> TDB : TX: inbox + đủ tập vé + COMPLETED + outbox + delivery\n  Ticket --> Payment : issuance-result\n  Payment -> PDB : TX: Saga result + outbox\n  Payment -> Booking : issuance-result\n  Booking -> BDB : TX: inbox + COMPLETED\nelse không chấp nhận\n  Payment -> PDB : TX: refund duy nhất theo charge\nend\nnote over Booking,Ticket\n  Mũi tên async là giao nhận ít nhất một lần qua outbox/broker/inbox.\n  Không có transaction xuyên DB. Timeout phát hành không cho quyền hoàn.\nend note\n@enduml",
